WEBVTT

01:31.062 --> 01:33.888
[Episode 8]

02:20.879 --> 02:23.280
Captain Di, can't you go easy on us?

02:23.280 --> 02:25.680
Exactly, we can't win at all.

02:25.680 --> 02:26.680
A bet's a bet.

02:28.080 --> 02:29.960
Only by winning do you get half a day off.

02:29.960 --> 02:31.072
It's a tradition.

02:34.159 --> 02:35.168
Who else wants to try?

02:38.752 --> 02:39.840
Your Majesty.

02:39.840 --> 02:41.199
Greetings, Your Majesty.

02:41.199 --> 02:44.159
No need for these formalities
during training.

02:44.159 --> 02:45.280
All of you, rise.

02:45.280 --> 02:46.479
Thank you, Your Majesty.

02:55.520 --> 02:56.759
Nian,

02:56.759 --> 02:59.800
haven't seen you in a few days,
and your skills have really leveled up.

02:59.800 --> 03:01.120
Your Majesty, you flatter me.

03:01.120 --> 03:03.280
I have not sparred with you
for quite some time,

03:03.280 --> 03:04.352
and my hands are truly itching for a bout.

03:05.159 --> 03:08.840
If you want to spar with His Majesty,
you'll have to get past me first.

03:08.840 --> 03:13.039
Don't forget. Last time we fenced,
you still owe me a drink.

03:13.039 --> 03:14.960
You only have your eye on my meager salary.

03:14.960 --> 03:15.960
I'll definitely win next time.

03:18.039 --> 03:22.560
The Divine Guard was personally trained
by the late Marquis back in his day.

03:22.560 --> 03:25.039
Now that it's in your hands,
I am very gratified.

03:28.000 --> 03:29.024
Nian.

03:30.000 --> 03:31.719
You have not dishonored your family's legacy.

03:31.719 --> 03:32.736
Father once said,

03:33.560 --> 03:37.639
the Divine Guard is Ning's sharpest spear,
and must always be kept sharp.

03:39.199 --> 03:42.840
Just like the Marquis,
you will also stand on your own

03:42.840 --> 03:43.919
and guard the border in the future.

03:47.879 --> 03:51.400
I remember your youthful ambition
was to don armor and go into battle.

03:53.120 --> 03:56.280
But now, you are trapped within the palace,
serving as my shield.

03:57.152 --> 03:58.240
My father passed away early.

03:59.800 --> 04:02.000
Your Majesty, it was you who gave me a place
to settle and find purpose.

04:02.840 --> 04:06.599
Now, protecting you
is my most honorable battlefield.

04:06.599 --> 04:08.840
I do so willingly.

04:12.319 --> 04:16.399
Now, with you and Di Nian by my side,
it's like having my left and right arms.

04:18.319 --> 04:21.839
The safety of the capital and me
rest on the shoulders of you two.

04:23.519 --> 04:24.800
Nian,

04:24.800 --> 04:27.199
I have one more thing to entrust to you.

04:27.800 --> 04:30.639
Select 12 light cavalrymen
and train them in secret.

04:31.360 --> 04:32.920
Your Majesty, you mean...

04:32.920 --> 04:35.040
You will know when the time comes.

04:35.040 --> 04:36.160
Yes, Your Majesty.

04:41.000 --> 04:43.120
The scholars enter the hall.

05:14.480 --> 05:16.120
Greetings, Your Majesty.

05:16.120 --> 05:18.560
May Your Majesty
be blessed with boundless fortune.

05:44.000 --> 05:45.399
I just bought
some Dong'e donkey-hide gelatin.

05:45.399 --> 05:46.400
Everyone, try some.

05:47.519 --> 05:48.560
Everyone, have a taste.

05:48.560 --> 05:49.760
- Here.
- Then I'll have one too.

05:49.760 --> 05:50.944
Thank you.

05:50.944 --> 05:51.959
Thanks.

05:51.959 --> 05:52.992
Come on.

05:58.199 --> 05:59.439
Meng.

05:59.439 --> 06:01.079
Today is the day the results are posted.

06:01.839 --> 06:04.224
Don't worry.
You will definitely pass the exam.

06:04.224 --> 06:05.280
Don't be nervous.

06:07.560 --> 06:09.399
Fu Zhi, I'm not nervous.

06:10.120 --> 06:11.808
But could you please stop pinching me?

06:16.720 --> 06:18.000
Here they come.

06:18.000 --> 06:19.072
Good news!

06:23.800 --> 06:25.759
Where is An Qing,
the scholar from the capital?

06:25.759 --> 06:27.279
Here. I'm here.

06:28.399 --> 06:30.839
Congratulations, Scholar An.
You are the 16th Jinshi of the second rank.

06:32.319 --> 06:34.319
I passed! I passed!

06:36.639 --> 06:38.600
Where is Zuo Qiu Rong from Jingzhou?

06:41.040 --> 06:42.160
I'm here!

06:42.160 --> 06:44.160
You have passed
as the 13th Jinshi of the third rank.

06:46.160 --> 06:47.560
I passed too!

06:47.560 --> 06:48.639
I passed too!

06:50.480 --> 06:52.319
Where is Lu Xiao Wan from Qingzhou?

06:53.319 --> 06:54.439
I'm here!

06:54.439 --> 06:55.879
The 16th Jinshi of the third rank.

06:57.600 --> 06:59.319
I passed. I passed too!

07:02.240 --> 07:03.328
Fu Zhi.

07:07.680 --> 07:11.199
What about your rank? Did something go wrong?

07:14.319 --> 07:15.360
Fu Zhi.

07:18.279 --> 07:20.120
I intentionally approached His Majesty
in the palace.

07:21.079 --> 07:23.600
He found out that I was eavesdropping
on his discussion of state affairs.

07:25.480 --> 07:26.800
Maybe I angered him.

07:27.600 --> 07:32.160
His Majesty's moods are unpredictable.
He wouldn't punish you, would he?

07:32.839 --> 07:36.600
He is the Son of Heaven.
Surely he wouldn't be so petty, would he?

07:47.439 --> 07:49.720
Meng Ting Hui, scholar of Shazhou,
receive the decree!

08:01.519 --> 08:02.560
Granted.

08:02.560 --> 08:07.279
After careful review of the exam rites,
and the talent selection in the Palace Exam,

08:07.279 --> 08:12.240
Meng Ting Hui from Shazhou Women's Academy
ranked first and is entitled Zhuangyuan.

08:12.240 --> 08:14.360
This is hereby proclaimed to the world.

09:01.519 --> 09:02.592
Fu Zhi.

09:04.480 --> 09:05.632
It's me.

09:09.760 --> 09:10.879
It's really me.

09:14.000 --> 09:15.399
I won the title of Zhuangyuan!

09:15.399 --> 09:16.919
I won the title of Zhuangyuan!

10:13.399 --> 10:16.120
Hesitation always means a troubled mind.

10:16.879 --> 10:20.759
Lord Xu,
His Majesty has proclaimed to the world

10:20.759 --> 10:24.679
that Meng Ting Hui
is our first female Triple First Zhuangyuan.

10:25.440 --> 10:27.159
With such favor,

10:27.159 --> 10:31.960
her future prospects are likely limitless.

10:32.679 --> 10:36.720
The new Zhuangyuan?
It is just a hollow title.

10:37.559 --> 10:39.679
Since she hasn't been granted a real post,

10:40.639 --> 10:44.000
we can send her back to her hometown
to await orders.

10:45.039 --> 10:47.840
Lord Xu, you're indeed a step ahead.

10:47.840 --> 10:49.799
Truly a veteran minister plans for the state.

10:50.559 --> 10:51.919
I submit.

11:03.600 --> 11:05.639
[Zhuangyuan]
In the first Special Exam of Ning,

11:06.320 --> 11:08.159
the title of Zhuangyuan

11:09.000 --> 11:12.720
goes to Meng Ting Hui, scholar of Shazhou.

11:19.552 --> 11:21.399
Congratulations, Zhuangyuan Meng!

11:21.399 --> 11:23.600
In the first Special Exam of Ning,

11:26.039 --> 11:27.840
the title of Zhuangyuan

11:29.080 --> 11:32.879
goes to Meng Ting Hui, scholar of Shazhou.

11:32.879 --> 11:39.232
[Zhuangyuan]

11:44.128 --> 11:45.159
Make way.

11:46.440 --> 11:48.840
Meng Ting Hui
really won the title of Zhuangyuan.

11:48.840 --> 11:51.040
Triple First? That's incredible.

11:51.040 --> 11:52.960
Our Chunman House has hosted a literary star.

11:52.960 --> 11:55.159
Ma'am, we must pay our respects
when we get back.

11:55.159 --> 11:57.000
Definitely. I'll take you to pay respects
when we return.

11:57.000 --> 11:58.159
Okay.

11:58.159 --> 12:00.440
- Zhuangyuan Meng once stayed at our inn.
- Zhuangyuan Meng!

12:00.440 --> 12:01.440
Really?

12:04.000 --> 12:05.280
- Miss Meng!
- Zhuangyuan Meng! Zhuangyuan Meng!

12:05.280 --> 12:06.840
Come to Chunman House!

12:12.600 --> 12:14.080
Meng!

12:14.080 --> 12:16.064
Meng! Meng!

12:16.064 --> 12:17.184
Meng, I'm here!

12:17.184 --> 12:18.240
Look.

12:18.240 --> 12:19.919
[Congratulations on achieving Triple First]
Look. Look over here!

12:20.679 --> 12:23.960
With talent as vast as the ocean,
you'll have everything you desire.

12:23.960 --> 12:25.360
She's my best friend!

12:25.360 --> 12:27.240
We came together!

12:27.240 --> 12:28.799
Meng, look!

12:28.799 --> 12:31.159
Congratulations to Zhuangyuan Meng!

12:31.159 --> 12:32.192
Look!

13:02.240 --> 13:03.296
Zhuangyuan Meng!

13:04.096 --> 13:05.159
Zhuangyuan Meng!

13:06.320 --> 13:07.456
Zhuangyuan Meng!

13:07.456 --> 13:09.120
Congratulations.

13:09.120 --> 13:10.240
Zhuangyuan Meng.

13:12.159 --> 13:14.840
See? We're very close.

13:17.320 --> 13:18.559
Zhuangyuan Meng!

13:19.679 --> 13:21.200
Congratulations.

13:45.240 --> 13:46.960
Look at this location.

13:46.960 --> 13:51.080
In the entire capital,
Changle Street is the most prosperous.

13:51.080 --> 13:52.960
Look at the shop you're considering.

13:54.000 --> 13:56.240
In front is the renowned signboard
of Lingluo Hall.

13:57.039 --> 13:59.600
Next door
is the long-established Yanzhi Pavilion.

13:59.600 --> 14:01.320
Across the street is Chunman House.

14:01.960 --> 14:04.000
If the owner
didn't have pressing family matters,

14:04.000 --> 14:07.759
he'd never
be willing to sublet such a prime shop.

14:10.559 --> 14:12.039
Great!

14:12.039 --> 14:14.440
This shopfront looks spacious and impressive.

14:14.440 --> 14:16.559
With a little tidying up,
it can open for business right away.

14:16.559 --> 14:20.759
If I make the most authentic mutton noodles,
my shop would outshine Chunman House any day.

14:20.759 --> 14:23.039
I really like this shop. I'll take it.

14:23.759 --> 14:26.120
Ms. Yan, you are truly straightforward.

14:26.120 --> 14:30.600
Then pay the deposit today, and you can
get the license from the Envoy of Customs.

14:30.600 --> 14:32.279
The Envoy of Customs?

14:32.279 --> 14:33.639
What does the Envoy of Customs do?

14:34.919 --> 14:38.759
The Envoy of Customs oversees the operations
of all the merchants in the capital.

14:38.759 --> 14:43.519
From inspecting ingredients and shop safety,
to collecting taxes.

14:44.600 --> 14:45.799
Speak of the devil.

14:45.799 --> 14:48.360
Mr. Shen here is the Envoy of Customs.

14:49.440 --> 14:51.600
Who did you say?

14:51.600 --> 14:54.720
Who in the whole capital doesn't know

14:54.720 --> 14:56.559
Mr. Shen Zhi Shu?

14:56.559 --> 15:00.159
To open a restaurant,
you'll need to get the license from Mr. Shen.

15:00.840 --> 15:04.159
If you're lucky,
you can open for business in three months.

15:04.159 --> 15:05.879
Why would it take so long?

15:05.879 --> 15:08.200
We're right under the Emperor's nose.
Naturally, the rules here are much stricter.

15:08.919 --> 15:11.919
The capital is not short of business people.

15:11.919 --> 15:14.080
The licenses are issued in limited numbers.

15:14.080 --> 15:16.799
If one doesn't have a local official
to act as a guarantor,

15:16.799 --> 15:19.639
waiting for a year or so is quite common.

15:21.600 --> 15:23.679
If I had known,
I wouldn't have kicked him out.

15:24.840 --> 15:26.120
Alright, let's talk about it next time.

15:27.136 --> 15:29.152
Mr. Shen.

15:30.112 --> 15:31.136
Here.

15:33.879 --> 15:35.200
Pretending not to know me?

15:38.960 --> 15:40.000
Mr. Shen.

15:41.184 --> 15:42.240
My apologies.

15:42.240 --> 15:44.559
I already reserved this room
with the manager.

15:44.559 --> 15:46.600
I didn't know you were still here.

15:48.200 --> 15:50.159
We came specifically for you.

15:58.759 --> 15:59.776
Mr. Shen.

16:02.159 --> 16:03.679
Come in.

16:03.679 --> 16:06.759
We've booked the entire Chunman House today.

16:06.759 --> 16:09.279
So we are all you've got.

16:10.279 --> 16:14.919
We've even prepared a vintage wine for you,
Chunfengzui.

16:16.120 --> 16:18.679
Let me pour some for you. Please, try it.

16:20.240 --> 16:21.320
Thank you.

16:21.320 --> 16:23.279
Mr. Shen, try it.

16:25.799 --> 16:26.976
How is it?

16:28.480 --> 16:30.639
I'll also fill your cup.

16:36.840 --> 16:40.639
Mr. Shen, it's been a while.
You've lost quite some weight.

16:42.320 --> 16:44.399
He was skinnier as a child.

16:44.399 --> 16:47.200
When we were young, his father
insisted on arranging a betrothal between us.

16:47.200 --> 16:50.320
I was the one who stubbornly refused,
so he gave up the idea.

16:50.320 --> 16:53.320
Now that I think about it, I really regret it.

16:59.200 --> 17:00.879
Speaking of childhood,

17:00.879 --> 17:04.119
Mr. Shen helped me chase away hornets
during the Shangsi Festival that year.

17:04.119 --> 17:07.000
Unexpectedly, he got stung
and swelled up like a fat-headed fish.

17:07.000 --> 17:08.119
I have a better story.

17:08.119 --> 17:10.480
As a child, he helped me catch small fish
in the river.

17:10.480 --> 17:13.200
He ended up falling into the river
and became a drowned rat.

17:17.559 --> 17:19.279
Why bring up things from the past?

17:19.279 --> 17:21.400
I have matters to attend to today,
so I'll take my leave now.

17:22.359 --> 17:24.039
Sit down! You're not going anywhere!

17:31.039 --> 17:32.400
Zhi Shu!

17:32.400 --> 17:35.640
We swore our love to each other
under the moonlit flowers in Shazhou.

17:35.640 --> 17:38.559
How come you've forgotten all about me
once we arrived in the capital?

17:38.559 --> 17:40.720
So it turns out you have two new sweethearts.

17:41.880 --> 17:42.880
Who is she?

17:43.519 --> 17:47.039
I am the one he holds in his heart,
the one he will marry with all proper rites.

17:47.039 --> 17:48.079
Who do you think I am?

18:00.480 --> 18:01.664
Sorry.

18:02.640 --> 18:04.559
My wife has a fiery temper.
Please forgive us.

18:06.000 --> 18:07.168
Wife?

18:15.279 --> 18:16.640
You shameless man!

18:16.640 --> 18:18.368
You scoundrel!

18:18.368 --> 18:19.392
You...

18:22.799 --> 18:23.904
Old habit.

18:27.680 --> 18:28.839
Ms. Yan.

18:28.839 --> 18:30.559
Although you helped me
out of a tight spot today,

18:30.559 --> 18:32.680
could you find a better way next time?

18:32.680 --> 18:34.880
Tell me. How are you going to thank me,
your savior?

18:38.039 --> 18:42.000
According to the stories, a life-saving debt
should always be repaid with marriage.

18:42.000 --> 18:43.559
But between us, let's forget it.

18:43.559 --> 18:45.200
I'm still in shock.

18:46.279 --> 18:48.480
Ms. Yan, if you have something to say,
just say it directly.

18:48.480 --> 18:50.720
Fine. I'll get to the point then.

18:50.720 --> 18:53.160
I plan to open a branch of Bofeng House
in the capital,

18:53.160 --> 18:54.720
serving the most authentic Shazhou cuisine.

18:54.720 --> 18:57.039
I've already picked the location,
right next door.

18:57.039 --> 18:59.559
But I've heard

18:59.559 --> 19:02.839
that getting a license can take a year or so.

19:02.839 --> 19:06.920
So I'd like to ask you to be my guarantor
and make things easier.

19:09.400 --> 19:11.160
I knew you were up to no good.

19:11.160 --> 19:12.759
Just apply according to the procedure.

19:12.759 --> 19:15.119
If you're selected,
someone will naturally notify you.

19:15.119 --> 19:16.880
You must agree.

19:16.880 --> 19:18.759
- What if I refuse?
- You...

19:19.839 --> 19:24.200
If you refuse,
I'll never speak to you again in the capital.

19:25.519 --> 19:28.079
Ms. Yan, your way of asking for a favor
is truly unique.

19:28.079 --> 19:30.319
But I am not one to fall for that.

19:31.744 --> 19:32.768
Farewell.

19:34.640 --> 19:35.920
Ten jars of Shaosanbai wine.

19:38.480 --> 19:40.079
What? I didn't hear you clearly.

19:42.759 --> 19:45.839
Plus special Shazhou wine.

19:45.839 --> 19:48.000
I advise you not to push your luck.

19:52.640 --> 19:54.960
I need to see your sincerity.

19:54.960 --> 19:58.279
How about this?
Cook me a table of Shazhou dishes yourself.

19:58.279 --> 19:59.360
Dream on!

20:02.960 --> 20:04.720
Then I'll just have to go drink elsewhere.

20:08.400 --> 20:09.408
Stop.

20:17.720 --> 20:21.279
Ten jars of Shaosanbai wine,
five jars of the special Shazhou wine,

20:21.279 --> 20:22.920
and a table of dishes I cook.

20:22.920 --> 20:23.968
Take it or leave it.

20:26.359 --> 20:27.759
It would have been so much better
if you were this straightforward earlier.

20:28.799 --> 20:29.880
Ms. Yan,

20:29.880 --> 20:32.400
next time you want to see me,
just send a note.

20:32.400 --> 20:35.552
No need to go through such a big detour
like today.

20:35.552 --> 20:36.608
You...

20:37.720 --> 20:38.848
Watch your tone.

20:39.480 --> 20:40.599
This is the capital.

20:45.312 --> 20:46.359
Get lost.

20:46.359 --> 20:47.920
Who wants to see you?

20:49.240 --> 20:51.319
- What did you say?
- I said,

20:52.359 --> 20:54.079
"Get lost! Who wants to see you?"

20:58.421 --> 21:00.780
[Shen Mansion]

21:40.519 --> 21:41.792
Thank you, Master.

21:44.160 --> 21:45.759
Uncle Gu, long time no see.

21:47.008 --> 21:48.119
Zhi Li,

21:48.119 --> 21:51.920
Mother and Father prepared a banquet long ago
to celebrate your success in the exam.

21:51.920 --> 21:52.928
Why are you only coming back now?

21:54.440 --> 21:55.640
Uncle Gu,

21:55.640 --> 21:57.960
we won't trouble you anymore.
I'll take Zhi Li home.

22:02.400 --> 22:05.400
May you remember your scholarly aspirations,
and may your future be as vast as the ocean.

22:05.400 --> 22:06.880
Your post at the Hanlin Academy
is already set.

22:06.880 --> 22:10.079
Remember. The imperial place
is the best for tempering one's character.

22:10.752 --> 22:11.808
Here.

22:12.559 --> 22:13.559
Thank you, Master.

22:15.480 --> 22:19.200
Uncle Gu, you should also go home early.
Don't worry your wife.

22:19.200 --> 22:21.920
If you have time,
remember to bring her to visit us.

22:24.119 --> 22:25.279
Go on now.

22:25.279 --> 22:27.799
- Your parents are waiting for you.
- Uncle Gu is right.

22:27.799 --> 22:29.680
Don't keep Mother and Father waiting.

22:29.680 --> 22:30.784
Let's go, Zhi Li.

22:36.559 --> 22:38.848
What did you just call me?
You're being disrespectful.

22:38.848 --> 22:39.872
Call me sister.

22:39.872 --> 22:41.279
Sister.

22:42.400 --> 22:44.320
Mother and Father
made a lot of delicious food today.

22:44.320 --> 22:46.119
You've been so busy with the Palace Exam.
You've lost a lot of weight.

22:46.119 --> 22:47.880
You must eat more later.

22:51.519 --> 22:55.359
The last dish,
my dear wife's favorite sweet and sour ribs.

22:55.359 --> 22:56.576
Let me try one first.

22:56.576 --> 22:57.920
Sit down and eat.

22:57.920 --> 22:59.359
Thank you, Father.

22:59.359 --> 23:01.319
Mother, we owe a lot to you today.

23:01.319 --> 23:03.599
I haven't had Father's cooking
in a long time.

23:03.599 --> 23:06.160
My handsome jawline is getting so sharp.
It's becoming way too obvious.

23:06.160 --> 23:08.720
When the cat's away, the mice will play.

23:09.696 --> 23:12.079
In my opinion,
you are living quite comfortably.

23:12.880 --> 23:16.599
You were appointed as the Envoy of Customs,
indulging in poetry and romance every day.

23:16.599 --> 23:20.079
Did you ask His Majesty for this position?

23:21.240 --> 23:23.079
Mother, look at Father.

23:24.000 --> 23:25.960
I'm doing serious, important work.

23:25.960 --> 23:28.279
Is it up to me to decide
what His Majesty asks me to do?

23:29.480 --> 23:35.000
You accused him of being a playboy, and now
you suspect him of currying favor for a post.

23:35.000 --> 23:38.880
What? Do you want your son
to be like those pedantic scholars,

23:38.880 --> 23:41.359
always wearing a stern face,
before you're satisfied?

23:43.456 --> 23:44.576
Thank you, Mother.

23:46.000 --> 23:49.720
His Majesty made him the Envoy of Customs.
So many eyes are watching.

23:49.720 --> 23:53.440
Any misstep will eventually give his enemies
the ammunition to attack him.

23:54.359 --> 23:58.920
Don't let his laid-back attitude fool you.
In real business, he never messes around.

23:58.920 --> 24:01.440
His Majesty values him, so he entrusted him
with such an important task.

24:02.440 --> 24:05.559
Dear sister, my love for you all these years
hasn't been in vain.

24:06.688 --> 24:07.872
Thank you, Father.

24:09.079 --> 24:13.160
Father, when it comes to the Envoy position,

24:13.160 --> 24:14.519
I'm the only one in the entire court
who can truly pull it off.

24:15.200 --> 24:17.640
I may have lived a life of luxury
on ordinary days,

24:17.640 --> 24:19.599
but the intricacies involved
are quite profound.

24:19.599 --> 24:20.704
Such arrogance!

24:23.000 --> 24:26.559
Others crave a path to success,
but you just drive yourself into a dead end.

24:26.559 --> 24:29.119
Before, you were at least a Court Advisor.
And now?

24:29.119 --> 24:31.640
You even have to submit a request in advance
just to attend the court session.

24:32.359 --> 24:33.799
Look at Nian.

24:33.799 --> 24:37.440
He's been more sensible than you since young,
never making your mother and me worry.

24:37.440 --> 24:38.960
He always thinks of us in everything.

24:40.672 --> 24:41.792
Thank you, Father.

24:42.400 --> 24:43.759
- Zhi Li.
- Nian, give it to me.

24:45.000 --> 24:49.079
Lacking ambition and constantly showing off,
you'll pay a heavy price sooner or later.

24:50.680 --> 24:52.200
Come on, Father. Try some.

24:55.319 --> 24:56.352
Mother.

24:57.720 --> 25:00.400
You don't even resemble me in the slightest.

25:01.920 --> 25:03.039
Even less like your mother.

25:04.079 --> 25:05.160
Look at Nian.

25:06.039 --> 25:08.440
What part of my eyes, nose, or mouth
doesn't look like yours?

25:08.440 --> 25:09.880
Nian, Nian, Nian.

25:09.880 --> 25:11.720
Anyone who doesn't know
would think Nian is your real son.

25:11.720 --> 25:15.160
If that were truly possible,
I would certainly want Nian to be my son.

25:16.519 --> 25:18.240
The Di family is full of loyal martyrs.

25:18.240 --> 25:20.480
At 18, Nian could already inspect the border
on behalf of His Majesty.

25:20.480 --> 25:25.279
You? Entertain His Majesty with amusements.
Where is the dignity of a court official?

25:25.279 --> 25:27.240
Stay out of the palace.

25:27.240 --> 25:30.799
His Majesty should be accompanied
by loyal and upright ministers like Nian.

25:30.799 --> 25:32.000
Wasn't that all for his sake?

25:32.000 --> 25:33.160
Alright, Zhi Shu.

25:33.160 --> 25:34.200
Enough talk.

25:37.440 --> 25:38.920
That also requires His Majesty
to be able to do without me.

25:39.559 --> 25:42.960
If I don't enter the palace, in three days,
His Majesty will come out to find me.

25:44.119 --> 25:46.400
Listen to him! What a load of nonsense!

25:46.400 --> 25:48.160
Can His Majesty not hold court without you?

25:49.680 --> 25:50.759
Nian, eat.

25:50.759 --> 25:55.400
You are the oldest child,
yet you are the most worrying.

25:56.039 --> 25:58.000
Anyone who doesn't know
would think you're the youngest.

25:58.640 --> 25:59.808
That's because I was born well.

26:03.839 --> 26:04.960
That's because you're foolish!

26:05.680 --> 26:07.599
Father, Mother.

26:07.599 --> 26:10.880
Isn't today supposed to be a celebration
for Zhi Li winning the Bangyan title,

26:10.880 --> 26:13.799
and landing her dream posting
at the Hanlin Academy?

26:13.799 --> 26:15.440
I even prepared a gift for her.

26:15.440 --> 26:17.680
Look at that. We forgot the main business.

26:17.680 --> 26:19.759
Li, your father and I
also prepared a gift for you.

26:27.279 --> 26:30.359
Thank you, Nian.
My gloves were just about worn out.

26:30.960 --> 26:32.200
Nian is the most considerate.

26:33.279 --> 26:34.880
Li, take a look at this too.

26:36.319 --> 26:40.519
Your father made these writing materials
back in the day.

26:40.519 --> 26:46.279
This inkstone was made of the Lanshan stone
gifted by the late Emperor.

26:46.279 --> 26:48.759
It stays warm in winter and cool in summer,
and keeps the ink fresh.

26:49.480 --> 26:51.119
Thank you, Father. Thank you, Mother.

26:51.119 --> 26:54.079
When I entered officialdom,
how come I didn't see anyone giving me gifts?

26:54.079 --> 26:55.559
What should we give you?

26:55.559 --> 26:58.759
Gambling chips made of golden-thread nanmu,
or dice carved from jade?

27:00.160 --> 27:03.039
Or pay to redeem
a few more of your lady confidantes?

27:05.119 --> 27:07.960
Father, am I your real son or not?

27:07.960 --> 27:09.319
Why do you oppose me at every turn?

27:09.319 --> 27:12.000
If you really think
I've tarnished the honor of the Shen family,

27:12.000 --> 27:13.088
I'll leave right now.

27:15.104 --> 27:16.192
Zhi Shu.

27:17.640 --> 27:19.000
It's fine. I'm full.

27:25.200 --> 27:26.640
Shen Wu Chen,

27:26.640 --> 27:29.400
must you hurt him deeply
before you're satisfied?

27:29.400 --> 27:33.000
You clearly care deeply,
yet you pierce his heart with every word.

27:33.640 --> 27:36.079
Zhi Shu has been doing very well
all these years.

27:38.400 --> 27:42.039
It's precisely because His Majesty treats him
as his best brother,

27:42.039 --> 27:43.319
and relies on him in every way,

27:44.039 --> 27:46.839
the court is even less tolerant
of any mistake he makes.

27:48.359 --> 27:52.680
The words of those censors
are three times sharper than swords.

27:56.640 --> 28:01.279
So you, as his father,
decide to point your sword at your son first?

28:03.759 --> 28:05.160
Look.

28:05.160 --> 28:07.680
This is the soup you personally made,
his favorite.

28:08.359 --> 28:09.400
He didn't even take a sip.

28:25.600 --> 28:27.840
[Chunman House]

28:33.799 --> 28:35.839
The appointment from Ministry of Personnel
still hasn't arrived.

28:37.640 --> 28:39.440
I don't know how much longer I have to wait.

28:40.599 --> 28:43.240
Meng, maybe it's because
your official position is so good

28:43.240 --> 28:45.680
that the pedants at the Ministry of Personnel
need to deliberate over and over.

28:46.640 --> 28:48.599
Zhuangyuan Meng,
the Ministry of Personnel sent a document.

28:48.599 --> 28:49.599
Coming.

28:52.672 --> 28:53.824
Thank you.

28:55.440 --> 28:56.480
Hurry!

28:57.279 --> 28:58.480
Let's see which cushy job it is.

29:08.279 --> 29:09.279
Return to hometown and await orders?

29:09.960 --> 29:11.359
This is impossible.

29:11.359 --> 29:13.400
I specifically went to inquire today.

29:13.400 --> 29:16.839
All the female officials from the same cohort
received notices and went to their posts.

29:16.839 --> 29:21.160
Shen Zhi Li and Jinshi Zuo Qiu Rong
were both assigned to the Hanlin Academy.

29:21.160 --> 29:25.200
Everyone has been assigned.
Only I am told to go home and wait.

29:26.519 --> 29:28.880
It seems someone
is determined to cut off my official career.

29:30.559 --> 29:33.519
Meng, you are the Zhuangyuan
personally selected by His Majesty.

29:33.519 --> 29:36.200
Who is so bold as to block your appointment?

29:36.200 --> 29:40.200
Who else could it be but Lord Xu?

29:42.039 --> 29:45.240
Fu Zhi, I can't just sit here and do nothing.

29:46.200 --> 29:49.119
I must find a way to enter the palace
and see His Majesty before dawn.

29:49.119 --> 29:50.440
We'll figure it out together.

29:51.160 --> 29:54.319
Anyway, I have money, and you have brains.
Nothing can stop us.

29:57.839 --> 30:00.559
Zhuangyuan Meng,
Lord Xu requests your presence.

30:01.888 --> 30:03.000
Meng,

30:03.000 --> 30:06.240
he wants to see you so late at night.
He must be up to no good.

30:06.240 --> 30:07.920
Maybe he wants to silence you.

30:07.920 --> 30:12.200
They've completely blocked the exits outside.
We're trapped here with no way out.

30:13.359 --> 30:16.079
I must go.

30:26.279 --> 30:30.240
Come on, my dear ministers.
Have another drink with me.

30:30.240 --> 30:31.720
Thank you, Your Majesty.

30:36.200 --> 30:38.759
The new Zhuangyuan, Meng Ting Hui,
has arrived.

30:58.960 --> 31:03.119
Meng Ting Hui, the Imperial Exam Zhuangyuan,
pays respects to Your Majesty.

31:03.119 --> 31:05.119
May Your Majesty
be blessed with boundless fortune.

31:17.200 --> 31:23.039
I summoned you to the palace tonight
in the name of Lord Xu to test your courage.

31:23.039 --> 31:25.079
You actually dared to come alone.

31:25.079 --> 31:28.240
Good! You have guts.

31:29.000 --> 31:30.480
Give Zhuangyuan Meng a seat.

31:34.440 --> 31:35.680
Thank you, Your Majesty.

31:39.960 --> 31:41.519
Meng Ting Hui,

31:41.519 --> 31:45.799
you achieving the Triple First
has truly brought me great honor.

31:47.440 --> 31:49.920
I am very pleased.

31:49.920 --> 31:53.359
I only had this opportunity
thanks to Your Majesty's protection.

31:53.359 --> 31:56.759
I will certainly not fail your grace
and will share your burdens.

31:56.759 --> 31:57.799
My dear ministers,

31:59.400 --> 32:01.720
let's toast to Zhuangyuan Meng together.

32:01.720 --> 32:03.559
To Zhuangyuan Meng.

32:06.000 --> 32:10.519
I am in a good mood today.
I also have a major announcement to make.

32:10.519 --> 32:12.559
Lord Xu has arrived.

32:28.440 --> 32:30.000
Your Majesty,

32:30.000 --> 32:33.480
you used my name
to summon Meng Ting Hui to the palace.

32:33.480 --> 32:36.680
Why didn't you inform me in advance?

32:38.960 --> 32:41.400
You're even drinking?

32:45.839 --> 32:47.640
Lord Xu, you're here?

32:47.640 --> 32:50.039
Today, the Imperial Exam for Women
has concluded successfully.

32:50.039 --> 32:53.200
I am pleased,
so I invited the ministers to drink together.

32:53.200 --> 32:54.272
Lord Xu.

32:55.119 --> 32:56.800
- Come have a drink with me.
- Your Majesty.

32:56.800 --> 33:02.640
Having served three reigns,
I've never seen a monarch act so improperly.

33:04.480 --> 33:05.640
Meng Ting Hui,

33:05.640 --> 33:08.640
the document from the Ministry of Personnel
didn't reach you?

33:08.640 --> 33:14.119
This is a banquet for sixth-rank officials.
Are you even qualified to sit here?

33:14.119 --> 33:18.039
Lord Xu, you even personally
inquire about a lowly nobody like me.

33:19.000 --> 33:24.759
So the order asking me to return and wait
was really your doing.

33:24.759 --> 33:25.984
Hold on.

33:27.599 --> 33:29.160
Return and wait?

33:29.160 --> 33:33.519
The female Zhuangyuan with Triple First
I selected to be entrusted with vital tasks

33:33.519 --> 33:36.599
became an idle person
with nowhere to be placed?

33:36.599 --> 33:39.160
Lord Xu, what is the meaning of this?

33:39.880 --> 33:41.160
Your Majesty, please see clearly.

33:42.480 --> 33:45.400
Currently, there are no vacancies
within the six ministries.

33:45.400 --> 33:48.599
If we assign her hastily,
wouldn't it be a waste of her great talent?

33:49.279 --> 33:50.680
Come on, Huo An.

33:51.359 --> 33:54.599
Escort Miss Meng back to Shazhou
to await her appointment.

33:54.599 --> 33:56.960
Since the six ministries
cannot place Meng Ting Hui,

33:56.960 --> 33:58.680
send her to the Censorate.

34:01.599 --> 34:05.200
The Heihu Crew in Shazhou,
the Huxiao Gang in the capital,

34:05.200 --> 34:06.759
Ding Chong who acts as their accomplice,

34:06.759 --> 34:09.024
and those like Dong Shou Cai
who deceive the court and mislead the people.

34:09.024 --> 34:11.639
How many more demons and monsters
are there in this land?

34:12.704 --> 34:13.824
You lot!

34:14.440 --> 34:19.360
You all turn a blind eye and play dumb,
as if nothing is happening.

34:19.360 --> 34:24.416
Then I will establish the Censorate
to eliminate the injustice of this world.

34:24.416 --> 34:28.000
Your Majesty,
do you think we are all incompetent?

34:28.000 --> 34:32.119
You want to establish a new institution
and employ such inexperienced newcomers?

34:32.119 --> 34:33.800
Let me ask you then.

34:34.920 --> 34:38.920
You are so impatient
to expel the talent I chose from the capital.

34:38.920 --> 34:41.360
What exactly are you trying to do?

34:43.320 --> 34:44.320
Your Majesty,

34:44.920 --> 34:46.920
establishing a new institution
is a matter of great importance.

34:46.920 --> 34:49.920
If we decide hastily,
I'm afraid it'll cause turmoil in the court.

34:49.920 --> 34:51.440
I've made up my mind.

34:52.199 --> 34:53.519
Starting today,

34:54.840 --> 35:00.039
Meng Ting Hui will be the Director,
independent of chancellors and ministries.

35:00.039 --> 35:01.639
She will report directly to me.

35:10.360 --> 35:11.639
I accept the decree.

35:11.639 --> 35:13.119
Thank you, Your Majesty.

35:13.119 --> 35:17.480
Since we need experience,
it would be more lively with more newcomers.

35:17.480 --> 35:19.840
Shen Zhi Li, as the Bangyan,

35:19.840 --> 35:23.280
isn't it boring to face old papers
at Hanlin Academy all day?

35:23.280 --> 35:29.119
Starting today, transfer her to the Censorate
to assist Meng Ting Hui.

35:30.496 --> 35:31.559
I accept the decree.

35:31.559 --> 35:32.640
Your Majesty,

35:33.280 --> 35:39.119
to entrust such a heavy duty to two girls
will simply cause chaos for the court.

35:39.119 --> 35:44.000
I beg you to withdraw your decree.

35:45.952 --> 35:47.072
Your Majesty!

35:47.072 --> 35:48.224
Your Majesty.

35:52.039 --> 35:57.599
Lord Xu, your rosewood dragon-head cane
may suppress the seals of the six ministries.

35:57.599 --> 36:00.599
Do you want to suppress my imperial seal too?

36:00.599 --> 36:02.360
Lord Xu, you use your seniority
to act arrogantly,

36:02.360 --> 36:04.719
going against my will repeatedly.

36:04.719 --> 36:09.719
Do you really think
I can't do anything to you?

36:11.079 --> 36:15.960
Your Majesty, do you know what you are doing?

36:24.079 --> 36:27.719
I was just joking with Lord Xu.

36:29.632 --> 36:30.719
Lord Xu.

36:32.159 --> 36:35.280
Did you really think I would hurt Lord Xu?

36:35.280 --> 36:40.320
Lord Xu is a pillar of Ning.

36:41.376 --> 36:42.400
Come on.

36:43.280 --> 36:46.639
Everyone, have a drink with Lord Xu.

36:46.639 --> 36:48.360
Your Majesty, you are drunk.

36:48.360 --> 36:49.536
Your Majesty.

36:49.536 --> 36:51.199
Your Majesty, be careful.

36:51.800 --> 36:53.159
Your Majesty.

36:53.159 --> 36:54.800
Drink with Lord Xu on my behalf.

36:57.559 --> 37:01.400
His Majesty never drinks.
How did he get so drunk today?

37:02.159 --> 37:04.280
Zhuangyuan entering the palace?

37:08.519 --> 37:11.079
It's clearly a sorceress.

37:22.528 --> 37:25.800
[Imperial Study]

37:25.800 --> 37:27.400
Your Majesty, slow down.

37:41.599 --> 37:42.840
Your Majesty,

37:42.840 --> 37:45.559
it's so late. Will Miss Meng really come?

37:55.776 --> 37:57.216
[Imperial Study]

38:06.480 --> 38:08.639
Imperial Guard Huang,
has His Majesty retired for the night?

38:16.000 --> 38:17.280
Please, Imperial Guard Huang.

38:21.984 --> 38:25.280
[Imperial Study]

38:48.760 --> 38:51.079
The banquet is over.
Why haven't you gone back?

38:55.800 --> 38:57.639
Your Majesty, you summoned me.

38:57.639 --> 38:59.559
When did I ever summon you?

38:59.559 --> 39:02.719
Since Your Majesty didn't,
I will take my leave.

39:08.679 --> 39:10.840
Why don't you bow when you see me?

39:16.159 --> 39:19.400
I, Meng Ting Hui,
pay respects to Your Majesty.

39:20.199 --> 39:25.000
I was worried that appointing you
as the Director of Censorate was too risky.

39:25.920 --> 39:28.719
Now, it seems that was unnecessary.

39:28.719 --> 39:33.639
If you truly thought that way, you wouldn't
have pretended to be drunk tonight

39:33.639 --> 39:36.760
and went to great lengths to stage this act
to promote me.

39:36.760 --> 39:41.360
You tried so hard to approach me.
Wasn't it for the post in the Censorate?

39:41.360 --> 39:42.840
I have granted your wish.

39:42.840 --> 39:44.800
But the heart of a monarch is hard to fathom.

39:44.800 --> 39:47.039
A few days ago, you refused me.

39:47.039 --> 39:51.039
Yet today, you promoted me publicly,
disregarding Lord Xu's opposition.

39:51.039 --> 39:54.760
I cannot see your mind clearly,
and that makes me even more uneasy.

39:57.440 --> 40:01.800
I gave you power beyond the two chancellors.
What more do you want?

40:01.800 --> 40:04.000
Do you have other designs?

40:09.800 --> 40:11.880
Your favor seems like a blessing,

40:13.119 --> 40:16.440
but isn't it also placing me
in the line of fire?

40:16.440 --> 40:18.719
If you insist on a return,

40:19.480 --> 40:24.360
I am willing to risk my life
to fully investigate the Huxiao Gang case.

40:25.119 --> 40:29.559
I ordered the investigation of Huxiao Gang,
but to this day, there is still no lead.

40:29.559 --> 40:33.199
How can a mere folk gang be so powerful?

40:33.199 --> 40:35.599
Your Majesty, you suspect
Huxiao Gang has influence in the court?

40:35.599 --> 40:37.239
Without a conclusion,
one must not speak recklessly.

40:41.440 --> 40:42.960
I await your surprise.

40:45.840 --> 40:48.039
I am willing to be the sharp blade
in your hand.

40:48.039 --> 40:50.239
But now, it's hard
to distinguish friend from foe in the court.

40:50.239 --> 40:52.599
I hope to select the Censorate members
all by myself.

40:52.599 --> 40:56.519
Apart from this, Zhi Shu and Di Nian
will assist you in the investigation.

40:57.400 --> 40:59.880
Thank you, Your Majesty.

41:20.288 --> 41:21.504
That one.

41:30.368 --> 41:31.424
It's here.

41:37.199 --> 41:38.840
Keep digging.

41:38.840 --> 41:39.872
Okay.
